Deployment policy (not release authorization)
---------------------------------------------
Copied deployments start in rules-only mode: INFERENCE_ENABLED is the string
"false". A deployer may opt into Workers AI inference on their own account
only with a separately authorized configuration change. The project transport
policy is MAX_REQUEST_BYTES = "16384": 16384 actual serialized UTF-8 request
bytes, not a token or neuron conversion and not a guarantee of <=50 neurons.

The page-session default cap is 40 attempts; it is not a server limit. Direct
calls are outside the page cap and consume the deployer's own account's shared
allocation. Free quota may be exhausted; Paid usage may incur charges.
